qore-v8-module (2.1.0~git20260928.1+ds-0qore1~ubuntu26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Package native bindings, two compiled/source helpers, tools, metadata,
    resources/translations, API docs, test examples and debug symbols.
    Split shared data into an architecture-independent package.
  * Support distribution Node.js builds without the built-in TypeScript
    compiler using the separately packaged TypeScript implementation.
  * Test against an offline synthetic Google Discovery schema and identify
    missing external modules and the optional HubSpot catalogue fixture.
  * Preserve app-specific authentication and grant checks in generic API
    calls from root and child providers; resolve helper documentation links.
  * Make the NetSuite schema tool stop after help and reject missing arguments.
  * Align native license metadata with its LGPL source notices.
  * Add installed runtime/compiler tests and reproducible offline profiles.

 -- David Nichols <david@qore.org>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 04:04:52 -0000
